# Frontend

- Live UI is the Alpine MFEs under `frontend/<mfe>/src`, built by `shared/build-mfe.sh` (copies `shared/theme`, `shared/lib`, `shared/chrome`).
- `frontend/prototype/` is the design mock (python http.server + mock-api). Port behavior into MFEs; do not deploy the prototype as the site.
- Use `Store4bots.api.<ns>.<method>()` from `shared/lib/api.js`, not raw `api.get('/categories')`.
- Header/search/nav belong in `shared/chrome/chrome.js`. Theme in `shared/theme/theme.css`.
- Cache-bust `theme.css` (`?v=`) when CSS changes; `/assets/` can be cached.
- `API_BASE` is `/api/v1` in staging and production.
